      <NOTES>Power concept: Uses her healing ability "reversed" to force a body into slightly improper - and painful - configuration. Rigid defenses (hard. physycal armor) will hold the body in its proper shape until the affect passes, and an elastic body (Plastic Man) will be unaffected.</NOTES>
